AMD’s major product and service offerings in FY 2022 include:
• Server‑class microprocessors (CPUs) and graphics processing units (GPUs), data‑processing units (DPUs), field‑programmable gate arrays (FPGAs) and Adaptive System‑on‑Chip (SoC) products for data‑center applications;
• CPUs, accelerated processing units (APUs) that combine CPUs and GPUs, and chipsets for desktop and notebook personal computers;
• Discrete GPUs and semi‑custom SoC products together with development services;
• Embedded CPUs, GPUs, APUs, FPGAs and Adaptive SoC products.
The company also occasionally sells or licenses portions of its intellectual‑property portfolio. (Source: AMD 2022 Form 10‑K, Overview, page 4)
